{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "target": "ES2019",
    "module": "ES2020",
    "moduleResolution": "node",
    "strict": true,
    "esModuleInterop": true,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "forceConsistentCasingInFileNames": true,
    "resolveJsonModule": true,
    "outDir": ".web-out",
    "rootDir": "."
  },
  "include": [
    "assets/scripts/core/**/*.ts",
    "assets/scripts/battle/**/*.ts",
    "web/**/*.ts"
  ],
  "exclude": [
    "node_modules",
    ".sim-out",
    ".web-out",
    "assets/scripts/ui",
    "assets/scripts/platform"
  ],
  "comments": [
    "浏览器运行原型：把纯逻辑层（core/battle）编译为 ESM，供 web/renderer.ts 在浏览器中直接运行。",
    "相对 import 缺 .js 后缀的问题由 tools/build-web.mjs 后处理修复。"
  ]
}
